isory only (the workflow runs but doesn't block merge). Close as part of 024C kickoff ceremony.\n- **TF-024B-SCAFFOLDER-023E002-UPDATE** (open): when TF-023E-002 closes, remove the post-v1.2.0 warning block from `scripts/scaffold-downstream.sh` and delete the cutover ancestry guard that keeps the v1.0.0 fallback recommendation alive. The scaffolder should stop warning only after the separate `attest-scorecard` workflow restructuring lands. Owner: @jrnb2024.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
